1. the hierarchy, classes only, up to Exception
   StandardError        StandardError < Exception
   RuntimeError         RuntimeError < StandardError < Exception
   ArgumentError        ArgumentError < StandardError < Exception
   TypeError            TypeError < StandardError < Exception
   NameError            NameError < StandardError < Exception
   NoMethodError        NoMethodError < NameError < StandardError < Exception
   ZeroDivisionError    ZeroDivisionError < StandardError < Exception
   KeyError             KeyError < IndexError < StandardError < Exception
   StopIteration        StopIteration < IndexError < StandardError < Exception
   FrozenError          FrozenError < RuntimeError < StandardError < Exception
   IOError              IOError < StandardError < Exception
   Errno::ENOENT        Errno::ENOENT < SystemCallError < StandardError < Exception
   SystemStackError     SystemStackError < Exception
   NotImplementedError  NotImplementedError < ScriptError < Exception
   LoadError            LoadError < ScriptError < Exception
   SyntaxError          SyntaxError < ScriptError < Exception
   SystemExit           SystemExit < Exception
   Interrupt            Interrupt < SignalException < Exception
   NoMemoryError        NoMemoryError < Exception
2. what a bare rescue catches (a bare rescue inside, rescue Exception outside)
   RuntimeError         caught by the bare rescue
   ArgumentError        caught by the bare rescue
   StopIteration        caught by the bare rescue
   Errno::ENOENT        caught by the bare rescue
   SystemExit           SLIPPED PAST it; rescue Exception caught SystemExit
   Interrupt            SLIPPED PAST it; rescue Exception caught Interrupt
   NoMemoryError        SLIPPED PAST it; rescue Exception caught NoMemoryError
   NotImplementedError  SLIPPED PAST it; rescue Exception caught NotImplementedError
   LoadError            SLIPPED PAST it; rescue Exception caught LoadError
   SystemStackError     SLIPPED PAST it; rescue Exception caught SystemStackError
3. a bare rescue is rescue StandardError
   StandardError === e                 true
   Exception.new.is_a?(StandardError)  false
   StandardError.superclass            Exception
4. rescue Exception swallows exit (the anti-pattern)
   swallowed SystemExit (status 1); the program goes on
5. a real stack overflow is not a StandardError
   slipped past the bare rescue: SystemStackError: stack level too deep
6. a method left as raise NotImplementedError is not caught either
   slipped past the bare rescue: NotImplementedError: Shape must define area
